          "worked": "The reference angle is $\\frac{\\pi}{6}$ and $\\frac{7\\pi}{6}$ is in quadrant III.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\operatorname{cosec}\\frac{7\\pi}{6}&=-2\\\\\\cot\\frac{7\\pi}{6}&=\\sqrt{3}\\\\\\sec\\frac{7\\pi}{6}&=-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}\\\\\\tan\\frac{7\\pi}{6}&=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\operatorname{cosec}\\frac{7\\pi}{6}+\\cot\\frac{7\\pi}{6}}{\\sec\\frac{7\\pi}{6}+\\tan\\frac{7\\pi}{6}}&=\\frac{-2+\\sqrt{3}}{-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}}\\\\\\frac{\\operatorname{cosec}\\frac{7\\pi}{6}+\\cot\\frac{7\\pi}{6}}{\\sec\\frac{7\\pi}{6}+\\tan\\frac{7\\pi}{6}}&=-\\sqrt{3}(-2+\\sqrt{3})\\\\\\frac{\\operatorname{cosec}\\frac{7\\pi}{6}+\\cot\\frac{7\\pi}{6}}{\\sec\\frac{7\\pi}{6}+\\tan\\frac{7\\pi}{6}}&=2\\sqrt{3}-3\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
